## Communications
## Photochromism
Back and forth: Through a classical pillarlayer structure constructed with mixed linkers, two photochromic metal–organic frameworks, PC-PCN and SO-PCN, have been developed. SO-PCN integrates a photochromic switch and photosensitizer, and has demonstrated reversible control of ${}^{1}{\mathsf{O}}_{2}$ generation (see figure).
